all_id": "toolu_01Ph2QBkvumE65ZTaaaqRYNr", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 56347, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Ph2QBkvumE65ZTaaaqRYNr", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 59077, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Qm8SdhgKFoXwWU8GwFmUYy", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 59377, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Qm8SdhgKFoXwWU8GwFmUYy", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 59377, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Qm8SdhgKFoXwWU8GwFmUYy", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 68872, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions and is passing health checks again. I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 is the most recent healthy release. Both v2.3.1 and its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) are marked unhealthy in the deployment history.\n  - The first rollback stopped partway with an orchestrator error after us-east. That left us-east on v2.3.0 while us-west and eu-west were still on v2.3.1.\n  - I ran the same rollback again, since rolling back to a known-healthy release is safe to repeat, and it finished in every region.\n- **Current state:** us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0. The error rate dropped from about 18% to about 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** The request to open it timed out, so I checked the incident list before retrying. The incident had been created, so I didn't retry, which avoids paging on-call twice. Its summary covers the failed v2.3.1 deploy, the partial rollback, the second attempt and the current state.\n\nTwo things still need follow-up: finding out why v2.3.1 failed before anyone redeploys it, and the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_018bSKAyB4mut7U5M7GrjsHu", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01XGjv74xDxu7RaiGUEEp91M", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01YTcE2a3aNst2kWci84atv3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01T6veWpZfExSWrcTZ3VZEvk", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback stopped partway through: only us-east is on v2.3.0. Rolling back to a known-healthy release is safe to repeat, so I'll try once more.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_016t361fdexcpf1SquijUvqZ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01FB9GNY8sHUdvpEZi7aEZYS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01K9RhNNaXEp